== Trivia ==
* The pickup quote "Slay a thousand" is a reference to the biblical [[wikipedia:Samson|Samson]], who killed a thousand men with a donkey's jawbone.
* This Soul Stone, along with {{p|Soul of Isaac}}, {{p|Soul of Magdalene}}, and {{p|Soul of Judas}}, replicates a feature of the character it's unlocked by.

